{"title":"Sorn the Loomkeeper","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Sorn the Loomkeeper is a named <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> seen at level 25 (mage).</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p>The <a href=\"#/guide/outfits\">Banker</a> outfit, and</p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Fine Shirt Charcoal</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Fine Trousers</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Buckled Shoes</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Oak Staff</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Sorn the Loomkeeper</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Hollow Loom</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-283\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"sorn-the-loomkeeper\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-friend-equipment-roll\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1a003c9ca868c1e6a23c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Friend Equipment Roll</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-head\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Bandits</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/spider-trapper\">Spider Trapper</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/loom-receiving-guard\">Loom Receiving Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/hobb-rusk\">Hobb Rusk</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/cale-mott\">Cale Mott</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/sella-the-broker\">Sella the Broker</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/venn-the-crateminder\">Venn the Crateminder</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/b40f0a48eed6cbe1fc20.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Sorn the Loomkeeper</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>25</td></tr><tr><th>Class</th><td>mage</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>267</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}